{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "class NewmanConwaySequence:\n    \"\"\"Manages the calculation of Newman-Conway sequence numbers, including memoization.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._cache = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    def calculate(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the nth Newman-Conway number using the recursive formula and memoization.\"\"\"\n        if n in self._cache:\n            return self._cache[n]\n\n        # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n - P(n-1))\n        pn_minus_1 = self.calculate(n - 1)\n        term1 = self.calculate(pn_minus_1)\n        term2 = self.calculate(n - pn_minus_1)\n        \n        result = term1 + term2\n        self._cache[n] = result\n        return result\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Provides a public, functional interface to calculate the nth Newman-Conway number.\"\"\"\n    calculator = NewmanConwaySequence()\n    return calculator.calculate(n)"}
