{"task_id": "Mbpp/104", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef sort_sublists(input_list_of_lists: List[List[str]]) -> List[List[str]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts each sublist of strings in a given list of lists alphabetically (lexicographically) ascending.\n    Returns a new list of lists with the sorted sublists.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_list_of_lists = []\n    for sublist in input_list_of_lists:\n        current_sublist_copy = list(sublist)\n        current_sublist_copy.sort()\n        sorted_list_of_lists.append(current_sublist_copy)\n    return sorted_list_of_lists"}
