{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in a list of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to avoid division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    zeroes = 0\n    non_zeroes = 0\n    for element in array:\n        if element == 0:\n            zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if non_zeroes == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(zeroes) / non_zeroes"}
