{"task_id": "Mbpp/388", "solution": "def highest_Power_of_2(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the highest power of 2 that is less than or equal to n.\n    For example, highest_Power_of_2(10) returns 8.\n    \"\"\"\n    power = 1\n    while (power << 1) <= n:\n        power <<= 1\n    return power"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the n'th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\n    Handles base cases L(0)=2 and L(1)=1, and applies the recurrence L(n) = L(n-1) + L(n-2).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    a, b = 2, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b"}
