{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(input_array: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts an array of numbers in ascending order using the Shell Sort algorithm.\n    The sorting is performed in-place.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_array)\n    gap = n // 2\n\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = input_array[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and input_array[j - gap] > temp:\n                input_array[j] = input_array[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            input_array[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return input_array"}
