{"task_id": "Mbpp/591", "solution": "def swap_List(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Interchanges the first and last elements of a list.\n    If the list has fewer than two elements, the original list is returned unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(input_list) < 2:\n        return input_list\n    \n    # Store the first element in a temporary variable\n    temp = input_list[0]\n    # Assign the last element to the first position\n    input_list[0] = input_list[-1]\n    # Assign the stored element (original first) to the last position\n    input_list[-1] = temp\n    \n    return input_list"}
