{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "def multiply_elements(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the product of adjacent elements in an input tuple of numbers.\n    Returns a new tuple where the i-th element is the product of the i-th and (i+1)-th elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(input_tuple) < 2:\n        return ()\n\n    results = []\n    for i in range(len(input_tuple) - 1):\n        results.append(input_tuple[i] * input_tuple[i+1])\n    return tuple(results)"}
