{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum, endnum):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range where every number is divisible by every digit it contains,\n    excluding numbers that contain the digit zero.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _get_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from an integer.\"\"\"\n        return [int(d) for d in str(number)]\n\n    def _is_divisible_by_all_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by all its non-zero digits and contains no zero digits.\"\"\"\n        digits = _get_digits(number)\n        for digit in digits:\n            if digit == 0:\n                return False  # Numbers containing '0' are excluded\n            if number % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    results_list = []\n    for current_number in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if _is_divisible_by_all_digits(current_number):\n            results_list.append(current_number)\n    return results_list"}
